---

<section style="background:var(--cu-navy);color:#fff;position:relative;overflow:hidden;padding:90px 0;">
  <div class="paws on-dark"></div>

  <div class="container-wide" style="position:relative;z-index:1;">
    <div style="max-width:780px;margin:0 auto;text-align:center;">
      <div class="eyebrow on-dark" style="justify-content:center;">
        <span class="tick" style="background:var(--cu-gold);"></span>Ready when you are
      </div>

      <h2 class="section-title" style="color:#fff;margin-bottom:20px;">
        Now you've heard about me. <span style="color:var(--cu-gold);">Tell me about your dog.</span>
      </h2>

      <p style="font:500 17px var(--font-sans);color:rgba(255,255,255,0.78);line-height:1.65;max-width:580px;margin:0 auto 32px;">
        Free 20-minute Meet &amp; Greet — phone or video, no pressure to book.
        I'll ask a lot of questions, you'll ask whatever you want to ask, and
        we'll figure out together whether I'm the right trainer for you.
      </p>

      <div style="display:flex;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center;align-items:center;">
        <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-gold btn-lg">
          Schedule a Meet &amp; Greet
          <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:18px;height:18px;"></i>
        </a>
        <a href="tel:9542688899" class="btn btn-ghost btn-lg" style="border-color:rgba(255,255,255,0.4);color:#fff;">
          <i data-lucide="phone" style="width:16px;height:16px;color:var(--cu-gold);"></i>
          954-268-8899
        </a>
      </div>

      <div style="margin-top:32px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font:500 14px var(--font-sans);color:rgba(255,255,255,0.6);">
        <span style="width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:#62D58A;box-shadow:0 0 0 4px rgba(98,213,138,0.2);"></span>
        Replies within 24 hours · Mon–Sat · 8a–7p
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
